      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_eWKHXj": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can bra inserts really help with breast asymmetry?",
            "row_content": "<p>Absolutely! Our non-slip bra inserts for uneven breasts are specifically designed to balance asymmetry, creating a more symmetrical appearance.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_B8ADGx": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are bra inserts comfortable to wear?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, our inserts are made with soft, gentle materials and designed for all-day comfort. Plus, their non-slip design ensures they stay in place, so you can move comfortably without any shifting.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_hNbeGU": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I determine the right size bra insert?",
            "row_content": "<p>Refer to our size chart to find the perfect fit based on your bra size and desired level of support.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_HkrYEK": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I wear bra fillers with different bra types?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, our bra inserts for uneven breasts are versatile and can be used with various bra types, including wireless, balconette, unlined, demi, convertible, strapless, underwire, bandeau, plunge. They also work well with bra alternatives like bralettes, sports bras, t-shirts, tank tops/camisoles with built-in support, shapewear, adhesive bras, and <a href=\"https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/swimsuit-inserts\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">swimsuits</span></a>.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_UUh8wL": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I wear Honey Cloudz balancing bra inserts without a bra?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, many women choose to use our balancing bra inserts for uneven breasts in swimsuits and <a href=\"https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/honey-cloudz-inserts-for-sports-bras\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">sports bras</span></a>. The non-slip design allows them to be worn comfortably and securely without the need for a traditional bra.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_LbznMa": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will these bra inserts show through my clothing?",
            "row_content": "<p>Our inserts are seamless and designed to be discreet and won't show through your clothing.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_Ai73ge": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can bra inserts help with post-surgery breast asymmetry?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, our inserts can be beneficial for women recovering from breast surgery such as mastectomies and lumpectomies to create a more balanced look.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
